Lo-res sphere. Based on an idea by Aexion, but smoothed out to
get a perfect DE.
Used those coordinates, instead of x,y,z to do the calculation
of DE = sqrt(x^2+y^2+z^2)-1;
x=round2(x)
round2(x) {
 x = Res*x
 // smooth mode normal:
 t = roundint(x)
 return (16*(x-t)^5)/Res
 // smooth mode old:
 t = roundint(x) + 0.5
 return ((x-t)^8)/Res
}

